<title>USA: TII Industries wins Puerto Rican contract.</title>
<headline>TII Industries wins Puerto Rican contract.</headline>
<dateline>COPIAGUE, N.Y. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>TII Industries Inc said on Monday that it had won a $6.5 million annual contract from the Puerto Rico Telephone Co to provide advanced network interface devices.</p>
<p>TII president Timothy Roach said TII currently supplies the government-run entity with about $2 million dollars in annual equipment sales.</p>
<p>TII specializes in the manufacture and sale of overvoltage surge protection, fiber optic and network interface products.</p>
</text>
